WEBVTT

00:00:03.815 --> 00:00:05.484
Angel…

00:00:10.322 --> 00:00:11.907
Angel…

00:00:27.422 --> 00:00:31.510
Be happy, my angel.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.960
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:04.760
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:09.600
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:15.310
And came to a standstill myself

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:20.480
We don't need no reasons

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:25.570
To change for the better

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:32.870
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:34.960
You're a shooting star

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:38.250
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:43.470
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.550
Light on the shooting star

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:51.560
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:54.680
Let's go in search of it

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:59.440
Fly away

00:02:07.781 --> 00:02:10.992
Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

00:02:10.992 --> 00:02:16.456
Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha…!

00:02:16.456 --> 00:02:19.501
Louder! Even if you have to force yourself!

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:21.545
Fortune comes to a merry home!

00:02:21.545 --> 00:02:24.506
Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha! Come on!

00:02:24.506 --> 00:02:27.551
--Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha…
--Stop!

00:02:29.344 --> 00:02:34.140
Watery tea made by used
leaves testes good! Come on!

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:37.102
--This tastes good!
--This tastes good!

00:02:38.687 --> 00:02:43.608
Maple leaves are tasty, too!
Now, you guys have some, too!

00:02:44.526 --> 00:02:46.444
Maple leaves taste good!

00:02:46.444 --> 00:02:49.906
We are happy, Miss Leop…
I mean, Miss Doronjo.

00:02:49.906 --> 00:02:52.701
Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha…

00:02:53.368 --> 00:02:55.036
Maple leaves are not food.

00:02:55.036 --> 00:02:58.206
Don’t complain! More importantly,
the way you’re speaking isn’t right!

00:02:58.206 --> 00:03:00.667
Speak like your ancestor! Here!

00:03:00.667 --> 00:03:02.085
Well, it’s easy to say that, but

00:03:02.085 --> 00:03:04.337
It’s quite difficult.

00:03:04.337 --> 00:03:10.051
Stop complaining!
You guys, if I say do it, just do it!

00:03:11.553 --> 00:03:14.514
You sounded just like the original Doronjo!

00:03:14.514 --> 00:03:16.057
Yeah, that was great!

00:03:16.057 --> 00:03:17.559
Oh, really?

00:03:17.726 --> 00:03:22.230
Oh, stop it. Teehee.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:25.483
Well then, let’s get on
with the strategy meeting.

00:03:25.483 --> 00:03:28.069
What do we do to make
our way into Yatter Kingdom

00:03:28.069 --> 00:03:31.156
and give Yatterman a forehead flicking?

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:35.869
Miss Leop… I mean, Miss Doronjo.
How should we make our way in?

00:03:35.869 --> 00:03:39.789
If we approach by boat,
they’ll probably shoot us again.

00:03:39.789 --> 00:03:41.583
Even if we could safely get closer,

00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:44.753
I think it’s impossible to climb over that wall.

00:03:44.753 --> 00:03:46.880
You guys think so too, right?

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:52.344
Volt… I mean, Boyacky…
Eh… Boyayan, was it?

00:03:53.511 --> 00:03:55.096
Boyayan is right.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:56.848
I know that, too.

00:03:56.848 --> 00:03:58.350
Then, what’re you going to do?

00:03:58.433 --> 00:04:00.894
I don’t know. That’s why
I’m saying let’s Think about it!

00:04:00.894 --> 00:04:02.145
Can you do something?

00:04:02.145 --> 00:04:04.230
Even if you say so…

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:07.484
Even with my power, I can’t break that.

00:04:27.712 --> 00:04:28.880
A tunnel?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.465
Tunnel, oink!

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:37.973
So we can get to the other side
of Yatter Kingdom’s wall...

00:04:37.973 --> 00:04:39.474
...straight from here?!

00:04:39.474 --> 00:04:42.644
We didn’t realize a tunnel like this existed!

00:04:42.644 --> 00:04:44.813
You’re amazing, Honorable Oda!

00:04:44.813 --> 00:04:49.484
Now, Boyacky, prepare a vehicle.
Tonzra, open up the entrance.

00:04:49.484 --> 00:04:53.071
Here goes, hey, hey, hey!

00:04:53.071 --> 00:04:54.447
Here goes, hey, hey, hey!

00:04:54.447 --> 00:04:57.492
--Just wait, Yatterman!
--Here goes, hey, hey, hey!

00:04:58.576 --> 00:05:04.165
Just wait, Mom. We’ll go give them
a forehead flicking with all our might!

00:05:13.758 --> 00:05:14.592
Finished.

00:05:14.592 --> 00:05:16.094
Thanks.

00:05:16.094 --> 00:05:18.013
How about you, Boyacky?

00:05:19.305 --> 00:05:21.349
Thank you for waiting.

00:05:24.853 --> 00:05:26.688
That’s pretty good!

00:05:26.688 --> 00:05:29.190
This isn’t an ordinary handcar.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:31.067
Well then…

00:05:33.361 --> 00:05:34.863
Let’s go, guys!

00:05:34.863 --> 00:05:37.198
Yes, ma’am!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:44.748
Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

00:05:44.748 --> 00:05:46.499
Are you okay, Tonzra?

00:05:46.499 --> 00:05:49.335
This is a piece of cake!

00:05:49.335 --> 00:05:51.129
You’re so dependable!

00:05:51.713 --> 00:05:54.549
We’ll find Yatterman up ahead.

00:05:55.967 --> 00:05:58.178
Don’t cry.

00:05:58.178 --> 00:06:01.598
I'm going to heaven now, that’s all.

00:06:06.561 --> 00:06:10.231
For our ancestors… and for us as well…

00:06:10.231 --> 00:06:13.443
We’ll give them a forehead
flicking for everyone’s sake!

00:06:17.572 --> 00:06:22.202
What should we do? Should we make
a machine to pump out the water?

00:06:22.202 --> 00:06:25.246
Or should we convert this handcar
so that it can go underwater?

00:06:25.246 --> 00:06:29.250
What about digging a tunnel to go around it?

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.460
Miss Doronjo?

00:06:30.627 --> 00:06:32.879
Guys, get in!

00:06:34.798 --> 00:06:36.716
Oof.

00:06:36.716 --> 00:06:38.760
Miss Doronjo, what are you going to do?

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:41.471
We can’t afford to waste time here!

00:06:44.349 --> 00:06:45.141
Don’t tell me…

00:06:45.141 --> 00:06:46.267
Are you really going to…?

00:06:46.267 --> 00:06:48.436
Yep, I'm really going to!

00:07:06.454 --> 00:07:07.747
I thought I was a goner.

00:07:07.747 --> 00:07:10.500
Miss Doronjo, you’re so reckless.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.794
Miss Doronjo, is this good?

00:07:12.794 --> 00:07:13.878
Yeah!

00:07:13.878 --> 00:07:17.632
Is this good, this spot? Or is
it better here? Or here? Here?

00:07:17.632 --> 00:07:20.844
Boyayan, what are you mumbling?

00:07:20.844 --> 00:07:25.640
Well, it seems my ancestor used to
tell dirty jokes every chance he got.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:28.309
So I thought l’d try my best to imitate him.

00:07:28.309 --> 00:07:31.187
You’re such a hardworking person, Boyayan!

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:35.441
So, Yatterman is up there.

00:07:54.335 --> 00:07:57.380
Here you go, Miss Doronjo.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.799
Yatterman!

00:07:59.799 --> 00:08:02.760
How dare you attack us the other day!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.262
I'm Doronjo!

00:08:04.262 --> 00:08:05.388
I'm Boyacky!

00:08:05.388 --> 00:08:07.182
I'm Tonzra!

00:08:07.182 --> 00:08:09.434
We came to punish you!

00:08:10.977 --> 00:08:12.770
We are…

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:15.231
Doronbow!

00:08:15.231 --> 00:08:18.693
Doronjo… Boyacky… Tonzra…

00:08:19.527 --> 00:08:21.112
As long as Doronbow exists,

00:08:21.112 --> 00:08:23.698
Yatterman will have no place in this world!

00:08:23.698 --> 00:08:27.702
We’ll drive the darkness away
and bring a new dawn to this world!

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:30.330
Here they come!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.247
Boyacky!

00:08:31.247 --> 00:08:33.291
Click.

00:08:46.054 --> 00:08:47.889
Forehead Flicking!

00:08:47.889 --> 00:08:49.891
It’s a forehead flicking mecha!

00:08:54.312 --> 00:08:57.398
Even a pig will climb a
tree when flattered. Oink!

00:08:57.398 --> 00:09:00.652
H-Honorable Oda! That was good! Very good!

00:09:00.652 --> 00:09:02.737
Right?! Right?!

00:09:04.489 --> 00:09:06.908
Guys, give them hell!

00:09:06.908 --> 00:09:09.035
Yes, ma’am!

00:09:16.918 --> 00:09:19.295
Here we go!

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:25.218
Forehead… Flicking!

00:09:30.181 --> 00:09:30.932
All right!

00:09:30.932 --> 00:09:32.267
Perfect flicking!

00:09:32.267 --> 00:09:34.185
A direct hit!

00:09:36.604 --> 00:09:39.607
How was that? Do you regret
what you did a little now?

00:09:39.607 --> 00:09:42.944
This is all because you Yatterman guys…

00:09:42.944 --> 00:09:43.987
H-Huh?

00:09:43.987 --> 00:09:45.196
Miss Doronjo?

00:09:45.196 --> 00:09:46.698
What’s the matter?

00:09:51.369 --> 00:09:53.121
This can’t be right…

00:09:54.664 --> 00:09:56.791
What the heck is this?

00:10:01.129 --> 00:10:02.130
Miss Doronjo.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:03.548
It’s coming!

00:10:10.388 --> 00:10:12.015
This isn’t fair.

00:10:14.017 --> 00:10:16.811
I thought we finally did it.

00:10:19.314 --> 00:10:22.275
I thought we were able to punish them!

00:10:25.153 --> 00:10:45.506
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:10:45.506 --> 00:10:49.677
Salute! Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:10:49.677 --> 00:10:51.721
Yatterman!

00:10:51.721 --> 00:10:52.889
Miss Doronjo!

00:10:52.889 --> 00:10:54.724
Come on, let’s go!

00:11:12.992 --> 00:11:17.246
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:11:17.246 --> 00:11:19.290
--Whoa!
--This never ends!

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.876
As it stands, no matter how much
we try, the real Yatterman won’t…

00:11:21.876 --> 00:11:23.628
Miss Doronjo!

00:11:28.091 --> 00:11:28.716
Wha…?!

00:11:28.716 --> 00:11:31.219
--This is…
--We’re in a fix!

00:11:43.481 --> 00:11:45.525
Don’t tell me…

00:12:01.791 --> 00:12:05.837
Yo ho… Yo ho… See ya!

00:12:26.441 --> 00:12:30.028
Hm? What? Are you asking
me to let you hide here?

00:12:30.028 --> 00:12:34.532
Yes. Mechanical soldiers that
look like Yatterman are chasing us.

00:12:34.532 --> 00:12:37.243
So…

00:12:37.285 --> 00:12:41.122
--E-Excuse me! Hello?!
--Stop knocking on the door! Just leave!

00:12:41.122 --> 00:12:42.957
M’ss Doronjo…

00:12:49.589 --> 00:12:51.383
Why?

00:12:51.383 --> 00:12:56.429
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:13:03.728 --> 00:13:06.648
To think that no one would help us…!

00:13:06.689 --> 00:13:09.901
Yatterman the only one
who needs a forehead flicking.

00:13:09.901 --> 00:13:13.279
Everyone in Yatter Kingdom needs one!

00:13:13.488 --> 00:13:15.073
--Honorable Oda!
--Honorable Oda !

00:13:15.073 --> 00:13:20.203
Hey! Didn’t your mothers teach
you that you have to respect pigs?!

00:13:20.203 --> 00:13:25.875
They seem to have a different
attitude toward pigs in Yatter Kingdom than we do.

00:13:26.543 --> 00:13:30.255
Don’t worry Honorable Oda. I’ll protect you.

00:13:30.255 --> 00:13:32.757
Hey, you’re drooling .
That’s nasty. Your drool!

00:13:32.757 --> 00:13:34.467
Oops.

00:13:35.718 --> 00:13:37.720
Miss Doronjo!

00:13:51.484 --> 00:13:53.027
Where are we going?

00:13:53.027 --> 00:13:54.821
We'll go anywhere

00:13:54.863 --> 00:13:58.533
I’ll find the real Yatterman
and give them a forehead flicking.

00:13:58.575 --> 00:14:02.787
The real Yatterman, huh...
I wonder where we can find them…

00:14:02.787 --> 00:14:05.957
We were finally able to enter Yatter Kingdom.

00:14:05.957 --> 00:14:08.543
We can’t let it end like this.

00:14:08.543 --> 00:14:10.044
Honorable Oda?!

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:17.010
Shh! Let’s avoid fighting here.

00:14:21.639 --> 00:14:23.016
Bye-bye.

00:14:23.016 --> 00:14:25.643
Oh no!

00:14:28.646 --> 00:14:30.523
That was close.

00:14:48.041 --> 00:14:49.584
Take this!

00:14:56.549 --> 00:14:58.510
G-Get out of here!

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:03.097
H-E-L-P!

00:15:12.732 --> 00:15:14.567
There really is something wrong with them.

00:15:14.609 --> 00:15:17.820
Heroes wouldn’t so aggressive!

00:15:24.925 --> 00:15:26.538
Yatter!

00:15:27.622 --> 00:15:28.581
We're hemmed in!

00:15:28.581 --> 00:15:31.334
--This is it!
--We’re done for!

00:15:32.043 --> 00:15:33.294
Yatter!

00:15:34.003 --> 00:15:35.255
Yatter!

00:16:06.411 --> 00:16:10.415
Angel… My angel…

00:16:16.296 --> 00:16:19.090
S-See?! We escaped!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:21.634
I never thought we’d jump from there…

00:16:21.634 --> 00:16:23.595
Ah-choo!

00:16:23.595 --> 00:16:28.766
As if it weren’t bad enough that our
clothes were already quite revealing…

00:16:28.808 --> 00:16:32.020
l’d normally welcome
revealing clothes, though.

00:16:33.896 --> 00:16:37.817
Well, we have no choice.
Let’s find a safe place to shelter.

00:17:44.592 --> 00:17:46.177
Looks like there’s no one around.

00:17:46.177 --> 00:17:47.220
Let’s go in.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.555
If we go in without asking,
we’re no different from thieves.

00:17:49.555 --> 00:17:51.349
When there’s no alternative,
you do what you have to do.

00:17:51.349 --> 00:17:55.645
As it stands, even if we
don’t get captured, we’ll freeze.

00:17:55.645 --> 00:17:59.148
J-Just this time… Just this time, okay?

00:17:59.148 --> 00:18:00.525
Yes, ma’am!

00:18:02.485 --> 00:18:03.194
It’s locked.

00:18:03.194 --> 00:18:05.363
What’re you doing?!

00:18:05.363 --> 00:18:06.239
Shall l break it?

00:18:06.239 --> 00:18:08.408
"Break it"?!

00:18:08.408 --> 00:18:10.201
J-Just this time!

00:18:11.703 --> 00:18:13.121
Honorable Oda!

00:18:15.456 --> 00:18:17.875
Ahh… It’s warm.

00:18:22.171 --> 00:18:24.215
Wh-What was that noise?!

00:18:24.215 --> 00:18:27.468
My belly button is… Please don’t look at it.

00:18:27.468 --> 00:18:30.012
Don’t scare me like that.

00:18:30.012 --> 00:18:32.473
Honorable Oda! Don’t eat that without permission!

00:18:32.473 --> 00:18:36.018
It’s the same as stealing! Don’t steal! Never!

00:19:04.172 --> 00:19:06.340
You know, Mom…

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:07.925
Yes?

00:19:07.925 --> 00:19:10.094
I love you.

00:19:10.094 --> 00:19:15.767
I love you too, Leopard… my angel.

00:19:27.111 --> 00:19:28.696
Mom…

00:19:30.114 --> 00:19:32.116
High-school girls…

00:19:33.659 --> 00:19:35.453
Honorable Oda…

00:19:54.555 --> 00:19:58.726
Gatchan… The angel didn’t come today either.

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:02.814
Gatchan…?

00:20:04.941 --> 00:20:06.943
Gatchan?

00:20:06.943 --> 00:20:09.362
Miss Doronjo, please put this on.

00:20:11.614 --> 00:20:16.828
A lark sang a song for me
when I was collecting firewood.

00:20:16.828 --> 00:20:21.374
l bet she was trying to comfort me.

00:20:21.374 --> 00:20:26.796
She said she’s going to a warm
place because winter is coming.

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:31.175
Gatchan…?

00:20:31.175 --> 00:20:34.804
Gatchan…? It’s not you, Gatchan?

00:20:34.804 --> 00:20:37.181
Who’s there?

00:20:37.181 --> 00:20:39.475
U-Uhm… we’re…

00:20:39.475 --> 00:20:41.853
Wow, such a cute voice.

00:20:41.853 --> 00:20:43.187
What?

00:21:03.332 --> 00:21:07.670
I'm shocked… as if I’ve been
struck by an electric current.

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:11.132
I'm… numb.

00:21:14.594 --> 00:21:16.387
U-Uhm…

00:21:16.387 --> 00:21:19.557
Oh, could it be…?

00:21:19.557 --> 00:21:23.519
Are you… possibly…?

00:21:23.519 --> 00:21:25.146
Huh?

00:21:38.743 --> 00:21:41.704
She’s warm.

00:21:41.704 --> 00:21:43.581
How cute…

00:21:43.581 --> 00:21:45.166
Uhm…

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:51.172
l knew it.

00:21:51.172 --> 00:21:54.842
I'm glad… You finally came.

00:21:54.842 --> 00:21:57.261
l’ve been waiting for you all this time…

00:21:57.261 --> 00:22:01.766
…my… my…

00:22:01.766 --> 00:22:03.100
"Angel"

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:17.990
Should I raise my RPM and dream?

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:25.620
Don't put it off for tomorrow, do it now

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:27.920
My strong heart wants to get started

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:30.000
I want to see change, so let's go

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:35.550
I'm running too fast to smell the roses

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:37.590
My strong heart's at max speed

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:40.180
I made a wish because I wanted a change

00:22:40.180 --> 00:22:44.140
I search, I tire, I fall, and I get back up

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:50.770
I'll enjoy this every time

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:53.440
Continue your passion

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:55.900
Continue your passion

00:22:55.900 --> 00:22:57.190
I'll support you

00:22:57.190 --> 00:22:58.150
I'm on your side

00:22:58.150 --> 00:22:59.410
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:01.200
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:05.660
My drive ain't no work of fiction

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:06.870
I want to see you

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:07.910
Today, if I can

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:09.670
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:11.040
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:15.130
Don't you know?

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:16.460
Day and night, I'm missing you

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:17.800
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:17.800
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:19.720
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:20.180
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:20.180 --> 00:23:22.930
But continue your passions

00:23:22.930 --> 00:23:26.100
But continue your passions

00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:37.900
Keep praying and dreaming
